          "content": {
            "id": "eb5d3a17-59a8-3911-a60a-5d68f03255d8",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "2026 should be record year within the last decade of video games",
            "description": "<p>Are sales of video games and gaming hardware showing signs of slowing down? If so, what could this mean for games spending in 2026?</p>\n<p>Wedbush Securities managing director of strategic planning Michael Pachter sits down with Yahoo Finance markets and data editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> on Market Catalysts to share his forecast on video game sales for 2026, noting the release of Rockstar's long-awaited <em>Grand Theft Auto VI.</em></p>\n<p>Also catch Michael Pachter's analysis on the <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/why-trump-blocking-netflix-wbd-162609174.html\">bidding wars for Warner Bros. Discovery </a>(<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Are sales of video games and gaming hardware showing signs of slowing down? If so, what could this mean for games spending in 2026? Wedbush Securities managing director of strategic planning Michael Pachter sits down with Yahoo Finance markets and data editor Jared Blikre on Market Catalysts to share his forecast on video game sales for 2026, noting the release of Rockstar's long-awaited Grand Theft Auto VI. Also catch Michael Pachter's analysis on the bidding wars for Warner Bros. Discovery (WBD). To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
