            "description": "<p>The 2026 Consumer Electronics Show (CES) is coming up next week in Las Vegas.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Technology Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/daniel-howley/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Dan Howley</a> sits down with Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> on Market Domination to explain what investors should expect from the event and from key names like Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) and AMD (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
